    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330290/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1684345233\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330290/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1684345233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330290/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1684345233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >We are looking for help and a community for our new project:</h2><br>Prepare to compete in the ultimate battle of home appliances! Socket Fighters is a 2D fighting game in which you can play against a friend or a bot in a one-on-one match. You can select your preferred appliance from a list that includes a washing machine, television, toaster, blender, vacuum cleaner, and more!<br><br>You can utilize basic strikes like kicks and punches in Socket Fighters, as well as five unique special attacks for each appliance. The washing machine, for example, can spit forth a sock, the television can fire a rainbow, the toaster can spew toast, and so on.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330290/extras/9e7a2c9b4e174c3b20fb8ab1cabbccd3.poster.avif?t=1684345233\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330290/extras/9e7a2c9b4e174c3b20fb8ab1cabbccd3.webm?t=1684345233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330290/extras/9e7a2c9b4e174c3b20fb8ab1cabbccd3.mp4?t=1684345233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The game takes place in a domestic setting, with battles taking place in a variety of areas such as the kitchen, bedroom, bathroom, hallway, and basement. Each chamber has its own collection of active elements that you can use during a fight. You can, for example, destroy a cabinet to discover a concealed weapon or hurl a chair at your opponent to deal extra damage. Other ways to engage with the environment include throwing a knife into a fan to create a hazard.<br><br>In Socket Fighters, prepare to rule the domestic arena. Will you be crowned the ultimate household champion?",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330290/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1684345233\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330290/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1684345233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330290/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1684345233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >We are looking for help and a community for our new project:</h2><br>Prepare to compete in the ultimate battle of home appliances! Socket Fighters is a 2D fighting game in which you can play against a friend or a bot in a one-on-one match. You can select your preferred appliance from a list that includes a washing machine, television, toaster, blender, vacuum cleaner, and more!<br><br>You can utilize basic strikes like kicks and punches in Socket Fighters, as well as five unique special attacks for each appliance. The washing machine, for example, can spit forth a sock, the television can fire a rainbow, the toaster can spew toast, and so on.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330290/extras/9e7a2c9b4e174c3b20fb8ab1cabbccd3.poster.avif?t=1684345233\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330290/extras/9e7a2c9b4e174c3b20fb8ab1cabbccd3.webm?t=1684345233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330290/extras/9e7a2c9b4e174c3b20fb8ab1cabbccd3.mp4?t=1684345233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The game takes place in a domestic setting, with battles taking place in a variety of areas such as the kitchen, bedroom, bathroom, hallway, and basement. Each chamber has its own collection of active elements that you can use during a fight. You can, for example, destroy a cabinet to discover a concealed weapon or hurl a chair at your opponent to deal extra damage. Other ways to engage with the environment include throwing a knife into a fan to create a hazard.<br><br>In Socket Fighters, prepare to rule the domestic arena. Will you be crowned the ultimate household champion?",
    "short_description": "Domestic appliances battle it out in this 2D fighting game. Fight in familiar household settings using everyday items as weapons. Enjoy unique character animations and special attacks for an action-packed experience!",
